*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Test PPD used by the node-printing end to end test. It is deliberately
*% neutral: a plain PostScript printer with a few page sizes, trays, duplex
*% and quality choices, so that the CUPS PPD parsing paths (defaults and
*% driver options) can be verified without real hardware.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "np-test.ppd"
*Product: "(node-printing)"
*Manufacturer: "Node Printing"
*ModelName: "node-printing test printer"
*ShortNickName: "NP test printer"
*NickName: "Node Printing test printer v1.0"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "10"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Node Printing;MDL:test printer;CMD:POSTSCRIPT"

*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*OpenUI *Resolution/Output Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 600dpi/600 DPI: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 1200dpi/1200 DPI: "<</HWResolution[1200 1200]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.53 595.28]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.28 841.89]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[419.53 595.28]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4: "18 36 577 806"
*ImageableArea A5: "14 32 405 563"
*ImageableArea Letter: "18 36 594 756"
*ImageableArea Legal: "18 36 594 972"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4: "595.28 841.89"
*PaperDimension A5: "419.53 595.28"
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal: "612 1008"

*OpenUI *InputSlot/Media Source: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *InputSlot
*DefaultInputSlot: Auto
*InputSlot Auto/Auto: ""
*InputSlot Tray1/Tray 1: ""
*InputSlot Tray2/Tray 2: ""
*InputSlot Manual/Manual feed: ""
*CloseUI: *InputSlot

*OpenUI *MediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 50 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: Plain
*MediaType Plain/Plain paper: ""
*MediaType Glossy/Glossy paper: ""
*MediaType Transparency/Transparency: ""
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Model: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 60 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 3>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorSpace 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Duplex/2-Sided Printing: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 70 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off: "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long edge: "<</Duplex true /Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short edge: "<</Duplex true /Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex

*OpenUI *cupsPrintQuality/Print Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 80 AnySetup *cupsPrintQuality
*DefaultcupsPrintQuality: Normal
*cupsPrintQuality Draft/Draft: "<</cupsPrintQuality (draft)>>setpagedevice"
*cupsPrintQuality Normal/Normal: "<</cupsPrintQuality (normal)>>setpagedevice"
*cupsPrintQuality High/High: "<</cupsPrintQuality (high)>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *cupsPrintQuality

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(001.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Courier-Bold: Standard "(001.004S)" Standard ROM

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
